# NOTE FOR GITHUB:
# models/*.joblib (67 MB total, RandomForest alone ~57 MB) and
# data/ISCX-URL2016_All.csv (11 MB) are INCLUDED in the ZIP submitted
# to the professor, but if `git push` warns about large files, either:
#   1) keep them (GitHub allows files < 100 MB), or
#   2) use Git LFS:
#        git lfs install
#        git lfs track "models/*.joblib" "data/*.csv"
#        git add .gitattributes
#   Then re-commit. Regenerating is also possible: run src/train.py.
